  selectTurtleLine: Welcome to the island! Click one of your turtles to select it.
  collectWoodLine: "Now click a tree. Your turtle will head over and start chopping
    \u2014 bring me 15 wood."
  collectStoneLine: Nice work. Select a turtle again and send it to a rock. We need
    5 stone.
  openBuildMenuLine: Time to build. Click the hammer to open the build menu.
  placeBedLine: Pick the Turtle Bed, then click somewhere on the sand to place it.
    That's another sibling hatched.
  keepCollectingLine: Great. keep stocking up while you can, theres a storm coming.
